  "title": "jeremypparker/mahler-hansen-cograph",
  "abstract": "A Lean 4/Mathlib formalisation of a sharp Mahler-volume theorem for Hansen polytopes of finite cographs. It proves that the normalized Mahler volume of the Hansen polytope of a cograph is at least one, and exactly one if and only if it is a threshold graph.",
